---
title: Spotify Listening Stats - Scheduled Ingestion
---
sequenceDiagram
	autonumber
	participant Cron as Cloudflare Cron
	participant Worker as Worker scheduled handler
	participant D1 as Cloudflare D1
	participant Accounts as Spotify Accounts
	participant API as Spotify Web API

	Cron->>Worker: Trigger every 5 minutes
	Worker->>D1: Read recently_played_after_ms cursor
	D1-->>Worker: Cursor or null
	Worker->>Accounts: POST refresh_token grant
	alt Token refresh succeeds
		Accounts-->>Worker: Short-lived access token
		Worker->>API: GET /me/player/recently-played?limit=50&after=cursor
		alt Recently played succeeds
			API-->>Worker: Items with track metadata and played_at
			Worker->>Worker: Validate, normalize, sort, and deduplicate by track ID plus played_at
			alt No accepted plays
				Worker-->>Cron: Complete without writes
			else Accepted plays exist
				Worker->>D1: Atomic batch: upsert albums, artists, tracks, track_artists
				Worker->>D1: INSERT OR IGNORE plays
				Note over Worker,D1: UNIQUE spotify_track_id plus played_at prevents duplicate plays
				Worker->>D1: Upsert cursor to newest accepted played_at milliseconds
				D1-->>Worker: Batch committed
				Worker-->>Cron: Ingestion completed
			end
		else Spotify returns 429 or request fails
			API--xWorker: Rate limit or upstream error
			Note over Worker,D1: No tight retry; failed run is observable and cursor remains unchanged
			Worker--xCron: Scheduled execution fails
		end
	else Token refresh fails
		Accounts--xWorker: Token error
		Note over Worker,D1: No D1 batch and no cursor update
		Worker--xCron: Scheduled execution fails
	end

